#import "dropdown"

// Laws for opening a dropdown. Each states the expected behavior
// independently of the implementation; `ziran check` proves it over every
// listed input. An implementation edit may not change this file.

// The press that opened a dropdown is remembered only while the pointer
// stays pressed, so the same press cannot also pick an item.
#law ClosedStaysUnmarked forall pressed: 0..1 => !DropdownJustOpenedNext(false, pressed != 0);
#law ReleaseClearsMark custom !DropdownJustOpenedNext(true, false);
#law HeldPressKeepsMark custom DropdownJustOpenedNext(true, true);
